# UI

Source of truth: [docs/UI-GUIDE.md](docs/UI-GUIDE.md). CSS lives only in `src/main/webapp/css/app.css`.

- Use CSS variables (`--color-*`, `--radius`, `--shadow`). Do not hard-code new hex in JSP.
- Reuse `.card`, `.btn-*`, `.alert-*`, `.data-table`, `.subtitle`, `.grid-2` before inventing classes.
- App pages include the shared header and footer.
- One job per page: title, short `.subtitle`, then the primary action.
- Cover empty, error, and success states. Stack grids on small screens.

```jsp
<%-- BAD: inline color --%>
<p style="color:#2563eb">Saved</p>

<%-- GOOD --%>
<p class="alert alert-success">Saved</p>
```
